{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261120/photo/bkn-20261120103904554-1120_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261120105452\"/><p>工廈平台有物件起火。</p><p>荔枝角發生火警。今日(20日)早上10時34分，有多名途人報案，指青山道688至690號嘉名工廠大廈一平台有物件起火冒出大量濃煙。消防接報派出搜救隊到場協助救援，火勢迅速被撲熄，幸事件中無人受傷，起火原因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T03:03:55.236229+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T02:39:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T02:57:28.596490+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T02:57:28.596490+00:00","content_hash":"0d1d8a5de298dafc3bd4c5fdb197d720e6aa46be2e765e5f6b59fac4c469903c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}